# Syr Alin, the Lion's Claw: "Whenever Syr Alin attacks, other creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn." (CR 611.2c.)
# Bot1 pays exactly {3}{W}{W} on turn 1 (Black Lotus and two Mox Pearls). On turn 3 Syr Alin attacks with a Memnite and an
# Ornithopter stays home: the trigger gives the Memnite (2/2) and the Ornithopter (1/3) +1/+1, not Syr Alin itself (still 4/4)
# and not Bot2's Memnite (1/1). Syr Alin has first strike. Nothing blocks: 4 + 2 damage (20 - 6 = 14). On turn 4 the
# pumps are gone (CR 514.2).

